  "employETitle": "E. Il sito",
  "employEWalk": "<a href=\"/\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/chat.html\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">Chat</a> · <a href=\"/employ.html\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">Impiegare</a> · <a href=\"/Launch-Ra-Thor.html\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">Avvio</a> · <a href=\"/micro-moment.html\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">Momenti</a> · <a href=\"/sovereign-shard.html\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">Frammento</a> · <a href=\"/web-forge.html\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">Forgia</a> · <a href=\"/contact.html\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">Contatto</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">Privacy</a>",
  "employFBody": "AG-SML: personale / ricerca / freelance modesto. Commerciale / organizzazione / ricavi → licenza a pagamento. Usi il <a href=\"/contact.html#commercial-inquiry\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">modulo di richiesta commerciale</a> o scriva a <a href=\"mailto:info@Rathor.ai\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">info@Rathor.ai</a>.",
